  "/facts": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n<meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"same-origin\">\n<meta name=\"htmx-config\" content='{\"includeIndicatorStyles\":false,\"allowEval\":false,\"allowScriptTags\":false,\"selfRequestsOnly\":true}'>\n<title>Your facts · jobpilot</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/app.css\">\n<script src=\"/static/htmx.min.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"top\">\n<div class=\"top-inner\">\n<a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">jobpilot</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/\">Jobs</a><a href=\"/freelance\">Freelance</a><a href=\"/companies\">Companies</a><a href=\"/facts\" aria-current=\"page\">Your facts</a><a href=\"/runs\">Runs</a></nav>\n</div>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<p id=\"htmx-error\" class=\"toast\" role=\"alert\" aria-live=\"assertive\" hidden></p>\n<div id=\"live\" class=\"visually-hidden\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"page-head\">\n<h1>Your facts</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\">Every claim your documents can make comes from one of these. Only verified facts and facts you stated go into a resume or cover letter. <strong><span class=\"num\">1</span> waiting for you to verify.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"note\">Verify and Reject change only the fact's status here (your facts.yaml is never edited). The next run makes the affected documents again.</p>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"facts\" aria-label=\"Facts\"><li class=\"fact fact-unverified fact-unused\" id=\"fact-f-nw-05\" data-live=\"Saved: Not verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Reduced AWS spend by roughly 30 percent through right-sizing and spot capacity.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Northwind Labs</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Jun 2023 – Jun 2024</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-nw-05</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-warn\">Not verified</span></p>\n<p class=\"fact-warn\">Not used in documents until you verify it.</p>\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-05/verify\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-05/verify\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-05-verify\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Verify</button></form><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-05/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-05/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-05-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-nw-01\" data-live=\"Saved: Verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Led the design of an event-driven order pipeline on Kafka handling 40M events a day.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Northwind Labs</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Mar 2022 – present</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-nw-01</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Verified</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-01/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-01/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-01-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-nw-02\" data-live=\"Saved: Verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Cut p99 latency of the pricing service from 800 ms to 180 ms by introducing a Redis read-through cache.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Northwind Labs</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Mar 2022 – present</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-nw-02</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Verified</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-02/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-02/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-02-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-nw-03\" data-live=\"Saved: Verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Migrated a multi-tenant SaaS billing module from a monolith to three microservices on Kubernetes.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Northwind Labs</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Mar 2022 – present</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-nw-03</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Verified</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-03/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-03/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-03-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-nw-04\" data-live=\"Saved: Stated by you.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Mentored four engineers and ran the weekly design review for the platform group.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Northwind Labs</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Jan 2023 – present</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-nw-04</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Stated by you</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-04/verify\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-04/verify\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-04-verify\" class=\"btn\">Verify</button></form><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-nw-04/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-nw-04/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-nw-04-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-ct-01\" data-live=\"Saved: Verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Built the payments reconciliation service in Java and Postgres, processing 2M transactions nightly.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Contoso Retail</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Jun 2018 – Feb 2022</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-ct-01</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Verified</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-ct-01/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-ct-01/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-ct-01-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-ct-02\" data-live=\"Saved: Verified.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Introduced RabbitMQ based retry queues that removed a class of duplicate-charge incidents.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Contoso Retail</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Feb 2019 – Jan 2020</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-ct-02</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Verified</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"post\" action=\"/facts/f-ct-02/reject\" hx-post=\"/facts/f-ct-02/reject\" hx-target=\"closest li\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\" hx-disabled-elt=\"find button\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"83bfff8c1933bd86bfb7c06cf17ba1eabb16fd15ff62095a33912822d74a6ffd\"><button id=\"fact-f-ct-02-reject\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Reject</button></form></div>\n\n</li><li class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-f-ct-03\" data-live=\"Saved: Stated by you.\">\n<p class=\"fact-claim\">Owned the on-call rotation and wrote the first runbooks for the checkout stack.</p>\n<p class=\"fact-sub\"><span>experience</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Contoso Retail</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"num\">Jan 2020 – Feb 2022</span><span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><code class=\"fact-id\">f-ct-03</code></p>\n<p class=\"fact-state\"><span class=\"pill pill-good\">Stated by you</span></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><form method=\"